::  name       mantra diff field count
::  shape      fields - int (@u32)
::  invariant  a Diff carries exactly three fields (site - inserts - deletes)
::  example    3
::  readers    Mantra - Glow Tend - Sur museum - Ashvini nest-only
::  nib        equinox-e205-mantra-tend-v0
::
::  Equinox e205 - Mantra M3 -- third Mantra structure pedestal in src/shape/.
::  Names Diff's field count from mantra/src/weave.rye: the authoring site,
::  the ordered insert texts, and the deleted line identities. Pedestal only;
::  Rye still owns advance.
::
::  Moved two to three on 20260906.212206. The site sits on the EDIT rather
::  than on the weave, because a weave is a shared history several hands merge
::  into one and an edit is the act of one hand -- so there is no honest answer
::  to whose a merged history is, and the question is never asked.
+$  mantra-diff-field-count-shape
  $:  fields=@u32
  ==
